Hi Brian,

I think this is a case for m_ply, which provides n arguments to the
calling function, rather than just one.  The following code should
work, but it's hard to be absolutely sure without a reproducible
example.

m_ply(cbind(x = test, col = col.lvls), lines)

Hadey

